   "id": "lead-1",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Hutchison and others v County Durham and Darlington NHS Trust was an employment tribunal case in the United Kingdom between a group of eight female nurses and the County Durham and Darlington NHS Trust over a policy at Darlington Memorial Hospital allowing transgender women to use women's facilities.",
