  {
   "id": "lead-2",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "On 16 January 2026 the tribunal judgement was published, concluding that the NHS trust had harassed and discriminated against the nurses by requiring them to share a changing room with a transgender women and by not taking the nurses concerns seriously.",
