    "in_place_since": "2025-10-22",
    "in_place_since_revision": 1318260292,
    "removals": []
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-3",
   "section": "Incident",
   "text": "Following this, Danson said that NHS managers had sat her down in a wellbeing room with a box of tissues and a cup of tea as she'd sobbed; however the NHS said that there was an \"absence of records\" regarding any such meetings.",
   "words": 44,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    44
   ],
