  {
   "id": "sec4-1",
   "section": "Context",
   "text": "In April 2025, while the Darlington nurse's lawsuit was ongoing, the UK Supreme Court issued its judgement in For Women Scotland Ltd v The Scottish Ministers, which ruled that the term \"woman\" under UK law referred to \"biological women and biological sex\".",
   "words": 43,
   "authors": [
