  {
   "id": "sec4-4",
   "section": "Context",
   "text": "In response, Hutchison expressed delight, saying that \"Stonewall-inspired policies that have allowed men to access women’s changing rooms in the NHS need to be urgently overhauled, and women like ourselves who have been discriminated against, as result of these policies, need full justice\".",
